.TH sam-jail-set 1 2026-11-19 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-set \- Set one permission, e.g. `sam\-jail set krita network.mode none`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail set\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> <\fIKEY\fR> <\fIVALUE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set one permission, e.g. `sam\-jail set krita network.mode none`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm a change that adds something rated Think twice or Dangerous (it is refused without, and says what)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>

.TP
<\fIVALUE\fR>

